nd joy in the simplest things.","audioSeconds":3.025,"runSeconds":0.164022364,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.163985904,"realTimeFactor":0.054222269090909096,"finite":true,"samples":72600},{"index":120,"text":"Type out three lists of orders.","audioSeconds":2.85,"runSeconds":0.15210552,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.15208249,"realTimeFactor":0.05337035789473684,"finite":true,"samples":68400},{"index":121,"text":"The harder he tried the less he got done.","audioSeconds":3.0,"runSeconds":0.161169029,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.161145469,"realTimeFactor":0.05372300966666666,"finite":true,"samples":72000},{"index":122,"text":"The boss ran the show with a watchful eye.","audioSeconds":3.25,"runSeconds":0.180111184,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.180083604,"realTimeFactor":0.055418825846153846,"finite":true,"samples":78000},{"index":123,"text":"The cup cracked and spilled its contents.","audioSeconds":3.2,"runSeconds":0.170324599,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.170298589,"realTimeFactor":0.053226437187499996,"finite":true,"samples":76800},{"index":124,"text":"Paste can cleanse the most dirty brass.","audioSeconds":3.325,"runSeconds":0.175683715,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.175658445,"realTimeFactor":0.05283720751879699,"finite":true,"samples":79800},{"index":125,"text":"The slang word for raw whiskey is booze.","audioSeconds":3.2,"runSeconds":0.169602393,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.169576143,"realTimeFactor":0.05300074781249999,"finite":true,"samples":76800},{"index":126,"text":"It caught its hind paw in a rusty trap.","audioSeconds":3.2,"runSeconds":0.182363864,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.182328683,"realTimeFactor":0.05698870749999999,"finite":true,"samples":76800},{"index":127,"text":"The wharf could be seen at the farther shore.","audioSeconds":3.025,"runSeconds":0.166179553,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.166143293,"realTimeFactor":0.054